            </note>
            <note corresp="#d12-f3" n="3" xml:id="d12-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to paragraph 3<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>. of NSC 48/2, “The Position of the United States with
                    Respect to Asia.” December 30, 1949. For text, see <ref
                        target="frus1949v07p2#pg_1215">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1949, vol. <hi
